Package: sitsfm
Type: Package
Title: Generate and test EO foundational models for time series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Gilberto", "Camara",
      email = "gilberto.camara.inpe@@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: This package evaluates foundational models for satellite image time series. 
  It compares three self-supervised encoders (masked autoencoders, LeJEPA, VICReg) and
  two supervised encoders (Barlow Twins, Supervised Constrastive Learning).
